---
---

<section class="section research" aria-labelledby="research-label">
	<div class="ruled research__grid">
		<p class="eyebrow research__label" id="research-label">Research<br />Interests</p>
		<div>
			<blockquote class="research__quote">
				My interest is in modeling biological systems computationally — using tools from
				optimization, machine learning, and (soon) topological data analysis to understand how
				complex biological processes behave and can be predicted or controlled. I'm particularly
				drawn to problems where the modeling technique has to be chosen to fit the biology, not the
				other way around.
			</blockquote>
			<p class="research__note">
				Currently building foundations in metabolic modeling (flux balance analysis) and systems
				biology.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.research {
		padding-top: 116px;
	}

	.research__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr;
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.research__label {
		margin: 0;
		padding-top: 12px;
	}

	.research__quote {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--ff-display);
		font-weight: 300;
		font-size: clamp(21px, 2.3vw, 30px);
		line-height: 1.44;
		color: var(--text);
		max-width: 820px;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.research__note {
		margin: 30px 0 0;
		font-family: var(--ff-mono);
		font-size: 12.5px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--muted);
		max-width: 560px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.research {
			padding-top: 92px;
		}

		.research__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 28px;
		}

		.research__label {
			padding-top: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
